  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n9991 x 10009\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(a + b )(a - b ) = a² - b²\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nWe can write \n\n⇒ 9991 = 10000 - 9\n\n⇒ and, 10009 = 10000 + 9\n\nAccording to the formula\n\n⇒ (10000 - 9)(10000 + 9) = (10000)² - (9)² = 100000000 - 81 = 99999919\n\n**⇒ Hence, The value of 9991 x 10009 is 99999919**",
